$ php bin/console doctrine:migrations:migrate --no-interaction --quiet
$ php bin/console shelf:import
Imported 4 books and 4 members
$ php bin/console shelf:password Amira < amira-password.txt
Saved a new password for Amira
$ php bin/console shelf:password Jonas < jonas-password.txt
Saved a new password for Jonas
$ php bin/console shelf:books
- Kindred (Octavia E. Butler, 1979): all copies on loan
- Kitchen (Banana Yoshimoto, 1988): available
- Parable of the Sower (Octavia E. Butler, 1993): available
- Things Fall Apart (Chinua Achebe, 1958): available
4 books
